---
title: An example note
date: 2026-10-24
description: A draft that shows how notes are written.
draft: true
---

Drafts (`draft: true`) appear only in `npm run dev`; in the published site
the Notes section stays hidden until there is at least one post that is not
a draft.

Formulas are written in LaTeX: inline, $L = \{a^n \mid n \equiv 0 \pmod 3\}$,
or displayed,

$$
\delta^*(q, wa) = \delta(\delta^*(q, w), a).
$$
